{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01886","headline":"杂曲歌辞 筑城曲五解 · 元稹","name":"杂曲歌辞 筑城曲五解","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年年塞下丁，长作出塞兵。\n自从冒顿强，官筑遮虏城。\n筑城须努力，城高遮得贼。\n但恐贼路多，有城遮不得。\n丁口传父口，莫问城坚不。\n平城被虏围，汉斸城墙走。\n因兹虏请和，虏往骑来多。\n半疑兼半信，筑城犹嵯峨。\n筑城安敢烦，愿听丁一言。\n请筑鸿胪寺，兼愁虏出关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01886.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01886","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}